{"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCWallet is the wallet side of "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/IDFoundry\/OID4VCgo"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for iOS 16 and macOS 13 and later. It handles SD-JWT VC and ISO mdoc"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Receiving","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them from a Credential Offer (OpenID4VCI 1.0, HAIP 1.0),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the authorization code or the pre-authorized code grant, deferred","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"issuance, batches of copies and refresh.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Presenting","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" them in answer to an ","type":"text"},{"code":"openid4vp:\/\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(OpenID4VP 1.0, HAIP 1.0), to Safari’s Digital Credentials API as an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iOS document provider (","type":"text"},{"code":"org-iso-mdoc","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ISO\/IEC TS 18013-7), and in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"person over Bluetooth (ISO\/IEC 18013-5), where the app can also be the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reader.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The protocols run in OID4VCgo’s Go code, compiled into the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mobile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"framework this package links: every network request, every protocol"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"message and every check on what comes back. Your app supplies the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"platform, through three protocols: a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" whose keys never leave"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the Secure Enclave, a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/CredentialStore"},{"type":"text","text":" under the device’s data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protection, and a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" that attests the wallet. It also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"owns the UI: every session stops where the holder needs to decide."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OID4VCgo is OpenID Certified for the OpenID4VCI and OpenID4VP wallet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"roles under HAIP, over links. The Digital Credentials API and in-person"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presentation aren’t covered by that certification."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Start with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/GettingStarted"},{"type":"text","text":", then the article for each task."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"collection","title":"OID4VCWallet","externalID":"OID4VCWallet"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Getting